-- The ONLY module that names `cmod`. `main.mdk` reaches cmod's constrained `pick` solely
-- through this hop, so the entry's source text never mentions the colliding module at all.
-- That is the property this fixture adds over its `-wildcard-import-callee/` sibling: the
-- poisoning reach of a bare-name arity table is the whole LOADED module set, not the entry's
-- own import list, so a user can be broken by a collision they cannot see in their own file.
import cmod as C

export hop : Int -> Int
hop n = C.pick n
